1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:02,544
[CLEARS THROAT] <i>Guys…</i>

2
00:00:04,921 --> 00:00:07,382
<i>I know I haven't been myself lately.</i>

3
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:13,430
<i>I hurt you.</i>

4
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:17,225
<i>And I'm… I'm so sorry.</i>

5
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:20,603
<i>I wasn't seeing the big picture.</i>

6
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:22,731
<i>It's not true that…</i>

7
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:25,150
<i>That I was doing it all on my own.</i>

8
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,067
<i>No.</i>

9
00:00:26,776 --> 00:00:30,196
<i>Because you're all here</i>
<i>through every struggle.</i>

10
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,866
<i>Just to keep this company afloat.</i>

11
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,827
<i>Thank you for putting up with me.</i>

12
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,498
<i>Chief?</i>

13
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:44,878
<i>Bea is here.</i>

14
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:48,173
<i>Billy,</i>

15
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:49,758
<i>I just wanted to make it clear</i>

16
00:00:49,841 --> 00:00:53,428
<i>that I have nothing to do with</i>
<i>the blackmail you're getting.</i>

17
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:56,181
<i>I came here because…</i>

18
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:59,225
<i>I want to help.</i>

19
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:02,687
<i>I know that I've done you</i>
<i>and LoveList wrong.</i>

20
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:04,856
<i>I'm not denying that.</i>

21
00:01:04,939 --> 00:01:07,192
<i>But I swear, this one isn't on me.</i>

22
00:01:07,275 --> 00:01:09,152
<i>I just want to help.</i>

23
00:01:09,235 --> 00:01:11,529
<i>Wow!</i>

24
00:01:11,613 --> 00:01:13,907
<i>Let's give this liar a round of applause!</i>

25
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:15,366
[EMPLOYEES CLAPPING]

26
00:01:15,450 --> 00:01:17,077
<i>Great acting!</i>

27
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:20,789
<i>After all you've done,</i>
<i>you want to help me?</i>

28
00:01:20,872 --> 00:01:22,123
<i>Why?</i>

29
00:01:22,207 --> 00:01:24,000
<i>To pretend that you've changed?</i>

30
00:01:24,083 --> 00:01:25,835
<i>Billy, that's not it.</i>

31
00:01:25,919 --> 00:01:29,923
<i>I want to help to prove to you</i>
<i>that I really have changed.</i>

32
00:01:30,006 --> 00:01:32,258
<i>No. You don't have to prove anything.</i>

33
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:34,552
<i>I won't believe anything you say anyway.</i>

34
00:01:34,636 --> 00:01:38,973
<i>The person you are right now?</i>

35
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:42,143
<i>You're a nobody.</i>

36
00:01:42,227 --> 00:01:44,145
<i>You're crossing the line.</i>

37
00:01:44,229 --> 00:01:48,316
<i>Don't act like you never did</i>
<i>anything wrong in your life.</i>

38
00:01:48,399 --> 00:01:50,819
<i>I wanted to change and help,</i>
<i>but you refused.</i>

39
00:01:50,902 --> 00:01:55,323
<i>You'd rather I stay evil?</i>
<i>Well, all right, then.</i>

40
00:01:55,406 --> 00:01:57,283
<i>I'll give you what you want.</i>

41
00:01:57,951 --> 00:02:00,078
<i>And I'll make sure you regret it, Billy.</i>

42
00:02:02,997 --> 00:02:04,374
[BILLY] <i>Exciting!</i>

43
00:02:06,126 --> 00:02:07,710
<i>I can't wait.</i>

44
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:15,385
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

45
00:02:19,222 --> 00:02:21,266
<i>- Who is that?</i>
<i>- I'll check.</i>

46
00:02:31,317 --> 00:02:32,277
<i>Bea?</i>

47
00:02:33,403 --> 00:02:34,445
<i>Mm-hmm.</i>

48
00:02:34,529 --> 00:02:35,488
<i>You're Karen, right?</i>

49
00:02:35,572 --> 00:02:39,868
<i>You're Jordan's father's partner.</i>

50
00:02:39,951 --> 00:02:41,578
<i>If you're looking for him,</i>

51
00:02:41,661 --> 00:02:43,454
<i>I don't know where that bastard is.</i>

52
00:02:43,538 --> 00:02:46,833
<i>Besides, how do you know where I live?</i>

53
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:51,045
<i>Uh, Karen. I have an offer.</i>

54
00:02:51,129 --> 00:02:52,380
<i>It's a good one.</i>

55
00:02:52,463 --> 00:02:54,507
<i>Offer? W-What offer?</i>

56
00:02:55,216 --> 00:02:57,260
<i>Aren't you going to</i>
<i>invite me inside first?</i>

57
00:02:57,343 --> 00:02:59,012
<i>Why should I trust you in the first place?</i>

58
00:03:00,096 --> 00:03:01,180
<i>So you know.</i>

59
00:03:01,264 --> 00:03:02,765
<i>Fine, it's hard to trust me.</i>

60
00:03:02,849 --> 00:03:04,434
<i>But believe me,</i>

61
00:03:05,226 --> 00:03:06,394
<i>I'm on your side.</i>

62
00:03:06,477 --> 00:03:07,729
<i>I'm your ally.</i>

63
00:03:08,897 --> 00:03:10,106
<i>Okay.</i>

64
00:03:11,065 --> 00:03:14,569
<i>I heard Billy and Jordan talking.</i>

65
00:03:14,652 --> 00:03:17,989
<i>You're blackmailing them, right?</i>
<i>You're asking for 10 million.</i>

66
00:03:18,865 --> 00:03:21,200
- [KAREN] <i>Just go.</i>
<i>- Hey! Wait.</i>

67
00:03:22,118 --> 00:03:23,161
<i>Oh!</i>

68
00:03:25,872 --> 00:03:27,874
<i>I thought you didn't know</i>
<i>anything.</i> [SCOFFS]

69
00:03:36,466 --> 00:03:43,473
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

70
00:04:42,782 --> 00:04:44,492
You're okay.

71
00:04:44,575 --> 00:04:46,119
You're her sister?

72
00:04:47,537 --> 00:04:49,247
Yes, I'm her sister.

73
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:53,418
But whenever something happens to her,

74
00:04:53,501 --> 00:04:55,586
she blames it on me.

75
00:04:55,670 --> 00:04:56,671
Gosh.

76
00:04:57,338 --> 00:04:58,339
Wow.

77
00:04:58,423 --> 00:05:01,217
So it's true that Billy
really despises you.

78
00:05:01,301 --> 00:05:04,053
She does. She made me and my mom suffer.

79
00:05:04,137 --> 00:05:06,389
That's why my mom is in prison right now.

80
00:05:06,472 --> 00:05:10,226
But now, it turns out that
she's also a criminal.

81
00:05:12,103 --> 00:05:14,939
So? Let me in on the gossip.

82
00:05:15,023 --> 00:05:16,149
Is it true?

83
00:05:16,232 --> 00:05:20,153
Is Billy the one
who killed Jordan's mother?

84
00:05:20,236 --> 00:05:21,487
You're not listening.

85
00:05:21,571 --> 00:05:24,699
I already told you that it was her.

86
00:05:24,782 --> 00:05:26,743
Oh? Really?

87
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:29,370
How would I know? I mean,
what if it was fake?

88
00:05:30,204 --> 00:05:32,582
[DINO] I thought you were on our side now.

89
00:05:32,665 --> 00:05:34,375
Why don't you believe my partner?

90
00:05:34,459 --> 00:05:36,294
Hey, it's not like that.

91
00:05:36,377 --> 00:05:37,879
I believe you.

92
00:05:37,962 --> 00:05:41,382
Of course, it works in my favor
if Billy is a criminal too.

93
00:05:41,466 --> 00:05:43,593
I can't wait to get back at her.

94
00:05:43,676 --> 00:05:45,720
She's such a horrible person.

95
00:05:45,803 --> 00:05:47,263
She has a terrible attitude.

96
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:51,559
Good thing I found you.

97
00:05:51,642 --> 00:05:52,769
Now I have allies.

98
00:05:53,519 --> 00:05:54,520
[BEA] <i>Cheers.</i>

99
00:05:54,604 --> 00:05:56,731
Bea really is something else.

100
00:05:56,814 --> 00:06:02,904
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

101
00:06:16,542 --> 00:06:19,087
We're on the same side, but remember,

102
00:06:19,170 --> 00:06:21,380
we're only allies up to Plan B.

103
00:06:21,464 --> 00:06:25,593
Plan B will only push through
if our scheme falls apart.

104
00:06:27,512 --> 00:06:29,847
<i>I'll send her a video and post it</i>

105
00:06:29,931 --> 00:06:31,849
<i>if she doesn't hold up</i>
<i>her end of the deal.</i>

106
00:06:31,933 --> 00:06:34,727
<i>But since I like to play it safe…</i>

107
00:06:34,811 --> 00:06:36,938
<i>Fine, I'll go along with your plan.</i>

108
00:06:38,147 --> 00:06:40,024
<i>Especially now that</i>
<i>my partner is pregnant.</i>

109
00:06:42,026 --> 00:06:44,070
[BEA] Pregnant?! Hey!

110
00:06:44,153 --> 00:06:45,196
[CHUCKLES]

111
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:47,782
Congratulations! Have a drink.

112
00:06:47,865 --> 00:06:50,493
Cheers! She's pregnant? That's great!

113
00:06:50,576 --> 00:06:57,583
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

114
00:07:02,713 --> 00:07:04,841
My father has no conscience.

115
00:07:05,633 --> 00:07:06,551
Jordan.

116
00:07:06,634 --> 00:07:10,388
What matters is, we now know
that he's the one behind this.

117
00:07:10,471 --> 00:07:14,475
Dude, he had something to do with
what happened to Mom.

118
00:07:15,518 --> 00:07:17,061
I know it.

119
00:07:17,145 --> 00:07:18,396
He knows something.

120
00:07:19,272 --> 00:07:20,815
He's just hiding it.

121
00:07:21,524 --> 00:07:22,525
[EXHALES SHARPLY]

122
00:07:22,608 --> 00:07:24,110
- Jordan…
- I need a drink.

123
00:07:29,198 --> 00:07:30,908
[JORDAN SIGHS]

124
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:33,786
We'll find out the truth soon, Jordan.

125
00:07:34,871 --> 00:07:36,289
We're almost there.

126
00:07:37,582 --> 00:07:38,708
I know.

127
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:43,421
That's not the only thing on my mind.

128
00:07:45,131 --> 00:07:46,340
Did you hear?

129
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:48,885
Karen is pregnant.

130
00:07:51,053 --> 00:07:53,473
I just don't want what happened
to Mom to happen again.

131
00:07:53,556 --> 00:07:57,268
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

132
00:07:57,351 --> 00:08:00,771
[PHONE RINGS]

133
00:08:02,064 --> 00:08:03,483
Yes, hello?

134
00:08:07,069 --> 00:08:08,738
Okay.

135
00:08:08,821 --> 00:08:09,864
Okay. Thank you.

136
00:08:14,911 --> 00:08:16,162
The money is ready.

137
00:08:17,038 --> 00:08:18,080
I'm coming with you.

138
00:08:18,706 --> 00:08:19,999
No, Jordan.

139
00:08:22,043 --> 00:08:23,503
I'll see you later?

140
00:08:23,586 --> 00:08:24,879
Billy.

141
00:08:29,258 --> 00:08:30,510
Be careful.

142
00:08:36,349 --> 00:08:41,646
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

143
00:08:49,445 --> 00:08:52,823
[MOTORCYCLE ENGINE RUMBLING]

144
00:08:52,907 --> 00:08:55,076
[DINO] <i>Fine, I'll go along with your plan.</i>

145
00:08:56,202 --> 00:08:58,120
<i>Especially now that</i>
<i>my partner is pregnant.</i>

146
00:08:58,913 --> 00:09:05,920
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

147
00:09:10,675 --> 00:09:12,635
- [SLAPS]
- [YOUNG JORDAN SOBS] <i>Sorry.</i>

148
00:09:12,718 --> 00:09:14,428
[DINDO] <i>You're being too nosy.</i>

149
00:09:15,263 --> 00:09:18,140
<i>- This is between your mom and me!</i>
- [JADE] <i>Dino, that's enough!</i>

150
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:19,392
<i>Leave the kid out of this!</i>

151
00:09:20,685 --> 00:09:23,896
[SOBBING] <i>Stop, Daddy! Please!</i>

152
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:25,231
<i>You're so annoying!</i>

153
00:09:25,314 --> 00:09:26,774
<i>- Why won't you listen?!</i>
<i>- Daddy!</i>

154
00:09:26,857 --> 00:09:29,819
<i>That's enough! You're hurting our son!</i>

155
00:09:29,902 --> 00:09:31,862
<i>Let go of him!</i>

156
00:09:31,946 --> 00:09:34,073
- [HIT LANDS]
- [GROANS]

157
00:09:34,156 --> 00:09:36,117
- [YOUNG JORDAN]<i> Please stop!</i>
- [SCREAMING]

158
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,493
[SOBS]

159
00:09:37,577 --> 00:09:43,874
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

160
00:09:51,507 --> 00:09:53,801
<i>Mommy, are you okay?</i>

161
00:09:56,304 --> 00:09:57,513
[MAKEUP CASE CLICKS]

162
00:09:58,264 --> 00:09:59,849
[THUDS]

163
00:09:59,932 --> 00:10:01,434
[SNIFFLES]

164
00:10:01,517 --> 00:10:03,644
<i>Well, of course I am.</i>

165
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:05,021
<i>I'm okay.</i>

166
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:07,732
<i>I'm okay.</i>

167
00:10:10,234 --> 00:10:11,444
[INHALES SHARPLY]

168
00:10:11,527 --> 00:10:16,616
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES, ENDS]

169
00:10:20,745 --> 00:10:22,079
Ralph, thank you.

170
00:10:22,663 --> 00:10:24,498
I'll give it back.

171
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:27,168
I just need to show the money
to Jordan's dad.

172
00:10:27,251 --> 00:10:29,337
Billy, I just… I just want
to let you know, okay?

173
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:31,547
I'm not worried about the money.

174
00:10:32,423 --> 00:10:33,883
I'm worried about your safety.

175
00:10:35,051 --> 00:10:36,427
Me too.

176
00:10:36,510 --> 00:10:41,182
What if we just report him
straight to the police?

177
00:10:42,933 --> 00:10:45,770
Well, Billy has to clear her name first.

178
00:10:45,853 --> 00:10:48,314
Then if he gets jailed again, [SIGHS]

179
00:10:48,397 --> 00:10:51,609
he will be just serving time
for his previous cases.

180
00:10:51,692 --> 00:10:54,236
They won't stop accusing me.

181
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,864
That's why we need to find out the truth.

182
00:10:57,823 --> 00:11:02,119
The truth needs to come
directly from Jordan's father.

183
00:11:04,914 --> 00:11:06,916
[BREATHES DEEPLY]

184
00:11:06,999 --> 00:11:11,712
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

185
00:11:13,714 --> 00:11:20,179
IF YOU KNOW WHAT'S GOOD FOR YOU,

186
00:11:20,262 --> 00:11:25,559
SHOW UP AT RAMP BAR AT 10 P.M..

187
00:11:28,145 --> 00:11:31,524
[UTENSILS CLINKING]

188
00:11:31,607 --> 00:11:32,733
[GUN COCKS]

189
00:11:32,817 --> 00:11:36,153
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

190
00:11:36,237 --> 00:11:38,072
[DINO SIGHS]

191
00:11:38,697 --> 00:11:39,907
Don't worry.

192
00:11:43,119 --> 00:11:45,454
We'll be millionaires once I come back.

193
00:11:45,538 --> 00:11:47,915
What if that Billy doesn't keep her word

194
00:11:47,998 --> 00:11:49,792
and brings the police with her?

195
00:11:51,043 --> 00:11:54,964
Maybe we should've
gone with Bea's plan instead.

196
00:11:56,882 --> 00:11:58,050
Why not?

197
00:11:58,134 --> 00:12:00,636
Once I get the 10 million,

198
00:12:00,719 --> 00:12:02,304
we're going to call Bea

199
00:12:02,388 --> 00:12:05,933
and tell her that we'll
take Billy's jewelry.

200
00:12:08,018 --> 00:12:09,895
<i>Wish Papa good luck.</i>

201
00:12:18,904 --> 00:12:25,911
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

202
00:12:25,995 --> 00:12:27,371
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

203
00:12:30,749 --> 00:12:32,168
Who's there?

204
00:12:32,251 --> 00:12:33,377
Who's--

205
00:12:33,461 --> 00:12:35,546
- Leave. Why are you here?
- Can we talk?

206
00:12:35,629 --> 00:12:37,298
Karen, wait, please!

207
00:12:37,381 --> 00:12:39,300
- Just listen!
- Leave!

208
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:42,303
[KAREN SIGHS SHARPLY]

209
00:12:42,386 --> 00:12:43,512
Karen.

210
00:12:44,638 --> 00:12:46,390
I know you know the truth.

211
00:12:46,474 --> 00:12:47,933
What are you talking about?

212
00:12:48,017 --> 00:12:49,768
You're just framing Billy

213
00:12:50,644 --> 00:12:53,731
so that another person takes the fall
for my mom's death.

214
00:12:53,814 --> 00:12:57,735
That friend of yours
is the one who killed your mom.

215
00:12:57,818 --> 00:12:59,445
I saw it with my own eyes!

216
00:12:59,528 --> 00:13:06,076
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

217
00:13:07,119 --> 00:13:10,581
My mom was wearing that necklace
the day she died.

218
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:13,584
When I found her body, it had disappeared.

219
00:13:13,667 --> 00:13:16,504
Next thing I know, you're wearing it.

220
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:20,549
So what about it?

221
00:13:20,633 --> 00:13:23,052
Just because of that necklace,

222
00:13:23,135 --> 00:13:25,471
your father was the one
who killed your mother?

223
00:13:25,554 --> 00:13:28,057
It's not enough proof, is it?

224
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:31,685
You know, I admire
how you support my father.

225
00:13:32,937 --> 00:13:34,146
Well, I get it.

226
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:38,359
He's the father of your child after all.

227
00:13:40,903 --> 00:13:43,113
Karen, I just hope

228
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:47,701
that he'll love and care for your baby.

229
00:13:47,785 --> 00:13:49,328
Unlike how he treated me.

230
00:13:52,498 --> 00:13:54,083
He should've protected me.

231
00:13:56,669 --> 00:13:58,212
Instead, he hurt me.

232
00:13:59,463 --> 00:14:00,548
My mom too.

233
00:14:02,049 --> 00:14:04,385
Did you know that she was
three months pregnant?

234
00:14:04,468 --> 00:14:07,304
But because my father beat her,

235
00:14:07,388 --> 00:14:09,223
she had a miscarriage.

236
00:14:09,306 --> 00:14:11,183
He did that till the day my mother died.

237
00:14:11,267 --> 00:14:13,894
- Get out.
- Look, Karen, please.

238
00:14:15,563 --> 00:14:17,648
My biggest regret in life

239
00:14:17,731 --> 00:14:20,693
is that I couldn't convince my mom
to leave my dad.

240
00:14:21,402 --> 00:14:23,571
If I had, she would still be alive today.

241
00:14:23,654 --> 00:14:27,449
I don't want that to happen again.

242
00:14:27,533 --> 00:14:28,617
To you.

243
00:14:31,871 --> 00:14:33,205
You still have a chance.

244
00:14:34,498 --> 00:14:36,292
You still have a chance to leave him.

245
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,546
Not just for yourself,

246
00:14:40,629 --> 00:14:43,883
but for your future child.

247
00:14:46,719 --> 00:14:48,721
For my future sibling.

248
00:14:48,804 --> 00:14:54,768
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

249
00:15:10,534 --> 00:15:16,582
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

250
00:15:33,891 --> 00:15:39,104
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]

251
00:15:42,191 --> 00:15:45,027
- Hey! Hey! Hey!
- Whoo!

252
00:15:53,702 --> 00:15:55,287
[BILLY] Excuse me.

253
00:15:55,371 --> 00:15:56,705
Excuse me. Sorry.

254
00:16:02,211 --> 00:16:03,712
Excuse me. Excuse me.

255
00:16:14,682 --> 00:16:16,183
Sorry. Excuse me.

256
00:16:18,143 --> 00:16:19,812
Excuse me.

257
00:16:21,355 --> 00:16:23,023
Excuse me.

258
00:16:24,692 --> 00:16:25,901
Excuse me.

259
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:31,782
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

260
00:16:38,539 --> 00:16:40,624
<i>Good evening, Ms. Billy.</i>

261
00:16:40,708 --> 00:16:43,168
<i>We finally meet. I'm Dino.</i>

262
00:16:57,099 --> 00:16:59,351
<i>There you go.</i>
<i>That's what you're asking for.</i>

263
00:17:00,811 --> 00:17:02,521
<i>I'm not in a hurry.</i>

264
00:17:03,689 --> 00:17:05,399
<i>But I won't decline either.</i>

265
00:17:14,491 --> 00:17:16,201
<i>I won't bother counting this here.</i>

266
00:17:17,536 --> 00:17:19,496
<i>You know what'll happen</i>
<i>if this isn't enough.</i>

267
00:17:20,122 --> 00:17:24,001
<i>How can I be sure that you will</i>
<i>no longer bother me after this?</i>

268
00:17:24,084 --> 00:17:26,295
[CHUCKLES]

269
00:17:26,378 --> 00:17:28,839
<i>Ms. Billy, you have my word.</i>

270
00:17:28,922 --> 00:17:30,424
<i>You don't have to worry.</i>

271
00:17:31,592 --> 00:17:32,843
<i>But you don't have a choice.</i>

272
00:17:32,926 --> 00:17:35,095
<i>Because if I don't get this money home,</i>

273
00:17:36,138 --> 00:17:38,307
<i>everyone will know that you're a criminal.</i>

274
00:17:42,144 --> 00:17:46,940
<i>You know that I had nothing to do with</i>
<i>Jordan's mom's death. Right?</i>

275
00:17:50,194 --> 00:17:51,862
<i>Who do you think did it?</i>

276
00:17:53,072 --> 00:17:54,114
<i>Me?</i>

277
00:17:55,365 --> 00:17:56,825
<i>Where's your evidence?</i>

278
00:17:57,826 --> 00:17:59,036
<i>Show me.</i>

279
00:17:59,119 --> 00:18:00,245
<i>Bring it out.</i>

280
00:18:01,497 --> 00:18:02,664
<i>You've got nothing.</i>

281
00:18:03,999 --> 00:18:07,169
<i>So just be quiet and thankful</i>

282
00:18:07,252 --> 00:18:10,798
<i>that no one will ever know</i>
<i>that you're a murderer.</i>

283
00:18:13,092 --> 00:18:17,346
<i>- Let's party!</i>
<i>- Yeah!</i>

284
00:18:18,722 --> 00:18:22,059
<i>Let's party! Party! Let's go!</i>

285
00:18:22,142 --> 00:18:23,894
[BILLY] <i>Excuse, excuse me.</i>

286
00:18:30,526 --> 00:18:33,278
<i>- Hey!</i>
<i>- Sorry, sorry!</i>

287
00:18:33,362 --> 00:18:35,781
<i>Bring your girl home! Go home!</i>

288
00:18:35,864 --> 00:18:38,325
<i>- Sorry, sorry, sorry.</i>
<i>- Go home!</i>

289
00:18:38,408 --> 00:18:39,868
<i>Whoo!</i>

290
00:18:41,954 --> 00:18:44,331
[DINO GRUNTS]

291
00:18:46,708 --> 00:18:48,293
- [DINO GRUNTS]
<i>- Sorry, sir!</i>

292
00:18:48,377 --> 00:18:50,796
<i>What the heck?! Can you just move aside?!</i>

293
00:18:50,879 --> 00:18:52,673
<i>- Sir--</i>
<i>- Sir, what happened?</i>

294
00:18:52,756 --> 00:18:54,633
<i>What--I'm sorry, sir. Did you get wet?</i>

295
00:18:54,716 --> 00:18:56,426
<i>- I just want to go.</i>
<i>- Yes, sir.</i>

296
00:18:56,510 --> 00:18:57,886
- [DINO] <i>Move!</i>
<i>- I'll pay for it.</i>

297
00:18:57,970 --> 00:18:59,847
<i>I just want to go! Move!</i>

298
00:19:01,056 --> 00:19:03,225
[KAREN] <i>What? Tell me!</i>

299
00:19:03,308 --> 00:19:05,727
<i>You killed Jade!</i>

300
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:07,813
[DINO]<i> It was her fault!</i>

301
00:19:07,896 --> 00:19:09,439
<i>It was all her fault!</i>

302
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:13,026
<i>Everything that happened</i>
<i>that day was Jade's fault.</i>

303
00:19:15,112 --> 00:19:17,865
<i>Jade was already dead</i>
<i>before she was run over?</i>

304
00:19:18,824 --> 00:19:21,869
<i>You killed your own wife?</i>

305
00:19:28,917 --> 00:19:32,296
<i>- Jordan! Jordan, no!</i>
<i>- Dino!</i>

306
00:19:32,379 --> 00:19:33,672
<i>- Jordan!</i>
<i>- Jordan!</i>

307
00:19:33,755 --> 00:19:35,007
<i>You.</i>

308
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:38,719
<i>You killed my mom!</i>

309
00:19:39,386 --> 00:19:40,804
<i>Jordan.</i>

310
00:19:40,888 --> 00:19:43,473
<i>- Jordan, son, I didn't mean to.</i>
<i>- Don't call me son!</i>

311
00:19:43,557 --> 00:19:45,767
<i>I didn't mean for that to happen!</i>

312
00:19:46,476 --> 00:19:48,312
<i>I didn't mean for her to hit her head!</i>

313
00:19:49,313 --> 00:19:50,856
<i>Jordan, she would've had me arrested!</i>

314
00:19:50,939 --> 00:19:52,858
<i>I didn't mean for it to happen.</i>

315
00:19:53,567 --> 00:19:54,693
<i>Surrender now.</i>

316
00:19:56,111 --> 00:19:57,863
<i>I can't surrender!</i>

317
00:19:59,823 --> 00:20:01,408
<i>Just give me the bag and I'll go!</i>

318
00:20:01,491 --> 00:20:03,535
<i>I'll vanish from your life!</i>

319
00:20:03,619 --> 00:20:05,037
<i>Or what?</i>

320
00:20:06,788 --> 00:20:08,332
<i>You'll kill me too?</i>
